BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 63.00 529.10 Tm (information, and internal reporters keep credit if they reach the SEC within 120) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 63.00 513.87 Tm (days. Most whistleblower attorneys skip reporting internally first on substantial) Tj ET
